# FE feature modules

Canonical layout (only create folders you need), from [bulletproof-react](https://github.com/alan2207/bulletproof-react) (~36k stars):

```text
src/features/<name>/
  index.ts              # public API only
  types.ts
  services/             # HTTP
  hooks/                # useQuery / useMutation
  components/           # kebab-case.tsx
  schemas/
```

## Naming (match shadcn + bulletproof)

- Files: `kebab-case.tsx` / `use-users.ts` — **not** `UsersTable.tsx`
- Folders: `kebab-case`
- Import other features **only** via `@/features/<name>` barrels

## Admin list (required split)

Do not grow a 400+ line table. Split like webhooks list/detail:

- `*-table.tsx` — hooks + layout (~80–120 lines)
- `*-table-columns.tsx` — column defs
- `*-form-dialog.tsx` + `*-form-fields.tsx` — RHF; **no API calls in fields**

Use shared `DataTable`. Pass `serverPaging` when the API is paginated. Do not set `localPagination={false}` without pager controls.

## Server state

- Reads/writes: TanStack Query in `hooks/` (query key factory per feature)
- Do **not** load server data with `useEffect` + `useState`
- Client-only UI state (dialog open) stays in the table component

## Kernel exception

`@/features/access-control` (RBAC) and `@/features/auth` barrels may be imported from admin chrome (`components/common`, `layouts`). One-way only. No deep paths.
